.TH SPACE 5 "October 2026" "APKGENG 1.12.5" "Amix File Formats"
.SH NAME
space \- disk space a package needs beyond its own files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B install/space
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR pkgadd (1M)
checks before installing that each file system has room for the files
the package's pkgmap(5) lists.  A package that will need more \- files
its scripts create, a database it grows into \- says so in a
.B space
file, named in its prototype(5) as
.BR "i space" .
.PP
Each line is
.PP
.RS
.I path blocks inodes
.RE
.PP
separated by white space.  Lines that are empty or start with
.B #
are ignored.
.TP 8
.I path
a directory or file; the amount is added to the file system that holds
it.  A relative path is taken under the package's
.BR BASEDIR .
.TP
.I blocks
512-byte blocks
.TP
.I inodes
files to be created
.PP
The check runs unless the admin file says
.B space=nocheck
.RB ( admin (5));
with
.B space=quit
(apkg's default) a package that does not fit is not installed.
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
# the cache the daemon builds at first start
/var/example/cache   20480   200
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR admin (5),
.BR pkgmap (5),
.BR prototype (5),
.BR pkgadd (1M)
